# p-hover-move (h11-p-drag): the pointer from the shift diamond (the origin,
# CSS (928, 490) at the default x²) straight onto P in ONE move. P has no
# onHover handler (7686c89), so nothing is lit, and the cursor is the open
# hand (grab-hover) because the hovered index is P (ea29aa9's derived
# hovering). A stepped move would re-hover the plane on the way.
# Behaviour (read on ref-h11 at c6754e7, WebKit/Chromium/Firefox alike):
# cursor grab-hover; the lit line empty; no q line.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 928 490
wait 300
move 1028 290
wait 300
shot p-hover-move
